e impressive scope of <i>Gorogoa's</i> personal narrative.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/557600/extras/b68ba6743271266056d70da459a78ccf.poster.avif?t=1729099787\" width=600 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/557600/extras/b68ba6743271266056d70da459a78ccf.webm?t=1729099787\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/557600/extras/b68ba6743271266056d70da459a78ccf.mp4?t=1729099787\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong>A NEW KIND OF STORYTELLING</strong><br><i>Gorogoa</i> isn't just a game - it's a work of art, expressing itself through soulful, charming illustrations and distinguished puzzle mechanics.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/557600/extras/7fed5cae066898e93f77b0e1f9f49146.poster.avif?t=1729099787\" width=600 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/557600/extras/7fed5cae066898e93f77b0e1f9f49146.webm?t=1729099787\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/557600/extras/7fed5cae066898e93f77b0e1f9f49146.mp4?t=1729099787\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>",
